Canada Civ
==========

This project is inspired by, and is a Canada counterpart to, **usaciv** by
Andrej Karpathy:

- Live site: https://karpathy.ai/usaciv/
- Announcement: https://x.com/karpathy/status/2125779541952246039
- MIT source zip: https://karpathy.ai/usaciv/usaciv-source.zip
- Copyright (c) 2026 Andrej Karpathy, MIT License

The trailer maker adapts usaciv's MP4 muxer, synthesised score, overlay and
storyboard technique. Its soundtrack is an original score synthesised in
JavaScript, adapted from usaciv's score.js under the MIT License; it is not
audio from the public usaciv announcement video. The adapted code remains
Copyright (c) 2026 Andrej Karpathy and is subject to the following terms:

